WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.130
Excuse me, how much is this necklace?

2
00:00:03.130 --> 00:00:05.280
That necklace is 800 for you.

3
00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:09.000
I see, I only have 1000, is that okay?

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.000
No problem, I have change to give you back. Here is 200.

5
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.870
And this ring? How much is this ring?

6
00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:23.000
That one is 300. Here you go.

7
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.220
Excuse me, give me another 100.

8
00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:27.740
But that is not right, do you have 1200?

9
00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:30.140
I do.

10
00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:34.160
You said this one is 800, and this one is 300.

11
00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:37.120
That is 1100 and I treat you to those 100.

12
00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:40.680
Thank you, take care. Okay, take care.
